title: Maiden Voyage
key: D
tempo: 126
style: jazz

// Thirty-two bars, AABA, four chords in all, four bars each, and not one of
// them a dominant that resolves: a suspended ninth on D, another a minor third
// up, the bridge's a half step above the first, and a minor ninth. Nothing
// pulls anywhere, so the players have to make the motion.
